 "law": "Tunnil's one-way prices for vehicles over 3,500 kg (the Faroese tunnel company; tunnels under løgtingslóg um undirsjóvartunlar): Vágatunnilin DKK 150 and Norðoyatunnilin DKK 150, charged only driving from Vágar and from Klaksvík (the price covers the return); Sandoyartunnilin DKK 800 each way; Eysturoyartunnilin Streymoy–Eysturoy DKK 800 and Strendur–Runavík DKK 200 each way. Free-flow (number plates); each charge is placed at the middle of the tunnel's longest way in OpenStreetMap; Eysturoyartunnilin's at the middle of each of its three branches (Streymoy DKK 800, Strendur and Runavík DKK 200), a trip through two branches paying the higher once. The page gives no date: valid_from is the day it was first read.",
